    "implementation_delta": "Add HardwareCapabilityLadder@1 and quarantine mock hardware detection plus CUDA mock implementations behind ipfs_accelerate_py.compatibility.simulation.fabricated_hardware. Ordinary legacy setup loads typed unavailable hardware instead of mock detection that reported cpu available=True. cuda_utils no longer substitutes MagicMock torch that can report is_available as true. create_cuda_mock_implementation requires explicit simulation and is labeled Simulated, never live. HardwareDetector and HardwareKit keep detection as a ladder rung: package import, nvidia-smi, Darwin platform, and adapter presence never imply production_authorized. Missing CUDA stays typed unavailable. Live CUDA remains unqualified. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
